1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
퇴근길 지하철, 입꼬리가 무거웠나요?
On the subway home, did your smile feel heavy?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,809
앤 라모트는 말했어요.
Anne Lamott wrote,

3
00:00:06,909 --> 00:00:16,391
플러그를 뽑으면 거의 모든 게 다시 켜진다고. 당신도요.
"Almost everything will work again if you unplug it for a few minutes, including you."

4
00:00:16,491 --> 00:00:23,500
쉼은 멈춤이 아니라, 다시 켜질 준비예요.
Resting isn't stopping.
It's getting ready to turn back on.

5
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
전원은 잠깐 꺼 두세요. 불은 제가 켜 둘게요.
Unplug for a while tonight.
I'll keep the light on.
